LanguageData.VGE_Warplatform.description:
An orbital bombardment platform has detected your gravship signature and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it locks in to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.

LanguageData.VGE_SalvagerStation.description:
A salvager orbital station is demanding tribute of {0} silver or it will open fire.

Time until tribute needs to be paid: {1}

You can ask them to postpone the payment, but the grav engine will be locked remotely until the tribute is paid or the station is defeated. You can also pay the fee immediately, if you have the funds. Running away will likely have the salvagers send a search party after you.

LanguageData.VGE_EnemyGravjumper.description:
An enemy gravjumper is locking in and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it arrives to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.

LanguageData.VGE_OrbitalCluster.description:
A mechanoid orbital combat cluster has locked in on your position and will attack soon.

Time until arrival: {0}

Moving away will likely delay the attack, but sooner or later an orbital cluster will need to be defeated to stop the threat.

LanguageData.VGE_EnemyGravship.description:
An enemy gravship is preparing the bombardment and will engage shortly.

Time until arrival: {0}

Move away before it arrives to avoid it, or prepare to fight it.
